<!-- Featured BMS -->
<div class="feat">
  <div class="gal">
    <div class="img g1" style="background-image:url(/bms4_8e2d.jpg)"></div>
    <div class="img g2" style="background-image:url(/bms2_dae8.jpg)"></div>
    <div class="img g3" style="background-image:url(/bms3_3e09.jpg)"></div>
    <div class="img g4" style="background-image:url(/bms1_6bb6.jpg)"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="fb">
    <div class="flag">FEATURED · FIG. 01</div>
    <h3>./Battery Management System Firmware</h3>
    <div class="org">Ontario Tech Racing · Formula SAE electric car</div>
    <p>Firmware for the Analog Devices LTC6813-1 battery monitor that keeps the car's high-voltage pack safe. I wrote it, then debugged and tested it on the bench and on the real pack.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Cell voltage and temperature monitoring across the pack</li>
      <li>Passive cell balancing</li>
      <li>Fault detection and error handling</li>
      <li>Microcontroller talks SPI through a transceiver that converts it to isoSPI</li>
      <li>Pack telemetry sent over CAN</li>
      <li>Verified with pytest SIL tests and bench HIL setups</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="tags">
      {["C/C++", "LTC6813-1", "isoSPI", "SPI", "CAN", "pytest", "HIL"].map(tag => (
        <span class="tag">{tag}</span>
      ))}
    </div>
    <a href="/projects/bms/" class="btn" style="margin-top:14px">Read case study</a>
  </div>
</div>

